%% Hy-Nomas interactive world generation loop: Prompt Enhancer, causal MMDiT with action-aware attention and camera cross-attention, KV cache — [From paper: Fig. 1 and Fig. 5, redrawn]
flowchart TD
    USER["User turn: free-form text or WASD / mouse camera"] --> PE["Prompt Enhancer VLM: structured JSON caption + duration"]
    HIST["Dialogue history + previous segments"] --> PE
    PE --> TE["Frozen Qwen2.5-VL-7B + token refiner (2048-d)"]
    USER -->|"camera turn"| CAM["Relative poses grouped by 4 to 64-D camera tokens"]
    TE --> DIT["Causal MMDiT, 54 blocks, 8B, action-aware causal mask"]
    CAM -->|"camera cross-attn in every block"| DIT
    KV["INT8 KV cache, sliding window: heads + video of past segments"] --> DIT
    DIT -->|"4 NFE flow-matching velocity"| LAT["32-ch latent segment (DCAE-V space)"]
    LAT --> DEC["One-step pixel diffusion decoder (FP8)"]
    DEC --> VIDEO["Video segment, e.g. 1280x704 at 24 FPS"]
    LAT -->|"re-noise sigma 0.206897"| KV
    VIDEO --> HIST
